WEBVTT

1
00:00:09,230 --> 00:00:10,390
The child may not be saved

2
00:00:10,390 --> 00:00:11,870
This incident drove him insane

3
00:00:11,870 --> 00:00:12,910
He treats every child he meets

4
00:00:12,910 --> 00:00:14,190
Treat them all as their own children

5
00:00:14,190 --> 00:00:16,670
Has my father really forgiven me?

6
00:00:16,670 --> 00:00:17,590
Your dad will pick you up soon

7
00:00:17,590 --> 00:00:18,630
Then my child

8
00:00:18,630 --> 00:00:19,550
Can he like it too?

9
00:00:19,550 --> 00:00:21,310
He told me about your child

10
00:00:21,310 --> 00:00:22,270
He likes them all

11
00:00:22,270 --> 00:00:23,350
My father's name is Liu Gang

12
00:00:23,350 --> 00:00:33,330
Grandpa, who is a big laborer, is coming soon. Be obedient later.

13
00:00:33,330 --> 00:00:34,250
Don't make him angry
